Notice ID               :         145307
Notice Type ID          :         RESERVE NOTICE
Notice Type Description :         LRC/LOR1/LOR2/LOR3
Issue Date              :         22/09/2026
External Reference      :         RESERVE NOTICE MT PASA 22 September 2026

-------------------------------------------------------------------

Reason :

The MT PASA results published on 22 September 2026 identifies no Low Reserve Conditions.

Low Reserve Conditions previously identified in:
- July 2028 in Victoria
are no longer forecast, as unserved energy is no longer forecast above the Reliability Standard in these regions and periods.

MT PASA informs the market of potential reliability issues to allow the market to respond in the first instance, potentially avoiding the need for any AEMO intervention.

For further information on MT PASA, please refer to:
https://www.aemo.com.au/Electricity/National-Electricity-Market-NEM/Data/Market-Management-System-MMS/Projected-Assessment-of-System-Adequacy.

For more information about how AEMO implements the reliability standard, please view the Reliability Standard Implementation Guidelines (RSIG) available on AEMO's website at https://www.aemo.com.au/energy-systems/electricity/national-electricity-market-nem/nem-forecasting-and-planning/forecasting-and-reliability/reliability-standard-implementation-guidelines.

This notice supersedes Market Notice 145162 published on 15 September 2026.

